  "notes": "&Tradition Flowerpot VP9 (design Verner Panton, 1968), the portable, rechargeable Flowerpot: Ø 16 cm, H 29.5 cm, 0.8 kg, lacquered polycarbonate and steel, a dimmable 3 W LED, about 10 hours on a charge (&Tradition's VP9 spec sheet). Modelled on the spec sheet's photo: a domed base, a thin stem, a bowl under a shade 16 cm across, and a chrome top ball. Burgundy by default (lacquer.burgundy), a colour &Tradition doesn't offer: its nearest are Dark Plum and Vermilion Red. Its colours: brass, chrome, cobalt blue, dark plum, grey beige, ivory, matt black, matt light grey, matt white, mustard, signal green, steel blue, stone blue, swim blue, tangy pink, vermilion red and zesty orange; pick the nearest lacquer or metal.brass / metal.chrome. Stands on tables, sideboards, shelves and ledges; the larger VP3 is table-lamp-flowerpot-vp3 (Ø 23 × 50 cm)."
